<#3342F5>Character Archetype:</> Glass-Cannon / Trapper
<#bebebe>all commands assume the player is facing the right.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<#3342F5>Specials:</>
Plate Bash - hold _B (charge), _F, ^X ^Y or ^Z
Corndog Spear - _F_D_DF, ^X ^Y or ^Z (hold to keep spear in place)
Sauce Toss - _D_DB_B, ^X ^Y or ^Z

<#3342F5>Hypers (All cost 1 Bar of Meter):</>
Rapid Corndog Combo - _D_DF_F, ^X_+^Y, ^Y_+^Z or ^X_+^Z
Spinner Frenzy - _D_DB_B, ^X_+^Y, ^Y_+^Z or ^X_+^Z (Air Only)
Condiment Cannon - _B_DB_D_DF_F, ^X_+^Y, ^Y_+^Z or ^X_+^Z

<#3342F5>Command Normals:</>
None.

<#3342F5>Basic Buttons:</>
Light - ^X (hold _D for crouch version, can also be done in the air)
Medium - ^Y (hold _D for crouch version, can also be done in the air)
Heavy - ^Z (hold _D for crouch version, can also be done in the air)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<#3342F5>Universal (All Characters):</>

<#bebebe>Basic Movement:</>
Crouch - hold _D
Walk - hold _F or _B
Full Jump/Short Hop - hold _U (full) or tap _U (short)
Dash/Backdash - double tap _F (and keep it held) or double tap _B
Taunt - ^A      

<#bebebe>Mechanics:</>
Guard - hold _B as opponent lands a attack (grounded only)
Dodge - ^X_+^Y_+^Z (hold back to dodge backwards)
Recovery Roll - hold _B or _F before getting up from a knockdown.
Air Tech Recovery - ^X_+^Y, ^Y_+^Z or ^X_+^Z while falling in the air.
Default Throw - [_B/_F]__+^Z (near opponent)
Throw Tech - [_B/_F]_+^Z (1-4 frame window to escape enemy throw)
Parry - Tap _F or _D as opponent hits you.
White Parry - Tap _F or _D as opponent hits your guard if not holding _B.
Universal Launcher - _U after landing _D_+^Z (cost half bar of meter)
Aerial Rave - finish a universal launcher combo with ^Z in the air 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<#3342F5>Corndog Orbs Mode</>
<#bebebe>counters give you orbs, get 3 of them to unleash.
and for weaker variant, release when you have 1 or 2 orbs.</> 

Summon Orbs - _D_+^A_+^X 
Orb Guard Cancel - _D_+^A_+^X while guarding <#bebebe>(cost full bar of meter)

<#bebebe>when Orb is out you are able to deal massive damage if opponent is
caught in the orb while you dodge around them with timing. it can
also be used both as offence and defence utility.

guard cancel only applies when you use the 3 orb attack. for 1 or 2 orb attack
your orb behaves like a boomerang projectile.</> 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<#3342F5>Tag Team Mode</>

Summon Partner - ^B (can't be done in hyper or if hurt)
Switch Partners - ^C (can't be done in special or hyper or if hurt.)

<#bebebe>when a partner is tagged out they will slowly get health back over
time. if you or partner dies then the one remaining will be tagged in.
lose both players and you lose the round.</>
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<#3342F5>Stocks Mode</>

<#bebebe>when KO'd, before the next round by holding _F, _B or _U you are
able to change the order your characters come out on at a time.
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
<#3342F5>Blitz Mode</>

<#bebebe>you are given a new meter you're tasked to fill up with combo hits up
to 11 with your normals and specials. theres a 1 second window to 
pick up your chain again if you miss before it depletes. when fully
charged you get access to Blazing Fury.

Blazing Fury is the most damaging universal attack in the game that can
also freeze the Timer and your Record time during its duration. get
as much of these as you can for fast record times.